        [("agreeableness_high", "oxytocin_h")] = "Hormonal OXTR activation in ventral pallidum and amygdala drives nurturing behavior and emotional warmth. Physical affection deeply rewarding. Social harmony experienced as physiological need. Caregiving instinct activated through oxytocin release.",
