        [("agreeableness_high", "endorphins")] = "Mu-opioid receptor activation from helping others, shared laughter, and prosocial bonding. Beta-endorphin release from altruistic acts — the neurochemistry of kindness rewarding itself. Social warmth as opioid experience.",
